"快速开始","permalink":"/docs/quick-start/"},"next":{"title":"关于我们","permalink":"/docs/about"}}],"drafts":[],"sidebars":{"tutorialSidebar":[{"type":"category","label":"OpenClaw 七天入门教程","collapsible":true,"collapsed":true,"items":[{"type":"doc","id":"day-tutorial/day-1"},{"type":"doc","id":"day-tutorial/day-2"},{"type":"doc","id":"day-tutorial/day-3"},{"type":"doc","id":"day-tutorial/day-4"},{"type":"doc","id":"day-tutorial/day-5"},{"type":"doc","id":"day-tutorial/day-6"},{"type":"doc","id":"day-tutorial/day-7"}],"link":{"type":"doc","id":"day-tutorial/index"}},{"type":"doc","id":"api/index","label":"API 参考"},{"type":"doc","id":"concepts/index","label":"核心概念"},{"type":"doc","id":"configuration/index","label":"配置指南"},{"type":"doc","id":"examples/index","label":"实例教程"},{"type":"doc","id":"quick-start/index","label":"快速开始"},{"type":"doc","id":"skills/index","label":"技能系统"},{"type":"doc","id":"about"},{"type":"doc","id":"home"},{"type":"doc","id":"pricing"}]}}]}},"docusaurus-plugin-content-blog":{"default":{"blogSidebarTitle":"Recent posts","blogPosts":[{"id":"welcome","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/welcome","editUrl":"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw-zh-docs/tree/main/blog/2024-03-13-welcome.md","source":"@site/blog/2024-03-13-welcome.md","title":"欢迎来到 OpenClaw 中文教程","description":"欢迎来到 OpenClaw 中文入门教程！","date":"2024-03-13T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"公告","permalink":"/blog/tags/公告"},{"inline":true,"label":"教程","permalink":"/blog/tags/教程"}],"readingTime":0.92,"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[{"name":"OpenClaw 中文社区","title":"OpenClaw 中文教程团队","url":"https://openclaw.ai","imageURL":"https://github.com/openclaw.png","key":"openclaw","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"welcome","title":"欢迎来到 OpenClaw 中文教程","authors":["openclaw"],"tags":["公告","教程"]},"unlisted":false,"nextItem":{"title":"Welcome","permalink":"/blog/welcome"}},"content":"欢迎来到 OpenClaw 中文入门教程！\n\n## 为什么要创建这个教程？\n\nOpenClaw 是一个强大的 AI 助手框架，但在使用过程中，我们发现许多中文用户希望能有更详细的中文教程和示例。因此，我们创建了这个网站，帮助更多中文用户快速上手 OpenClaw。\n\n## 网站包含什么？\n\n- 📖 **完整的中文教程**：从入门到进阶的详细指导\n- 💡 **实战案例**：真实的场景和解决方案\n- 🎯 **最佳实践**：使用技巧和注意事项\n- 🛠️ **API 文档**：完整的 API 参考手册\n\n## 谁适合阅读？\n\n- 想学习 AI 助手的初学者\n- 希望提升工作效率的创业者\n- 需要自动化工具的开发者\n- 电商运营、内容创作者等\n\n## 接下来做什么？\n\n建议你从 [快速开始](/docs/quick-start) 开始，5 分钟即可启动你的第一个 AI 助手！\n\n## 我们需要你的帮助\n\n这是一个开源项目，欢迎任何人参与贡献：\n\n- 📝 修正文档错误\n- 💬 分享使用经验\n- 🎨 改进网站设计\n- 🌐 提供翻译支持\n\n加入我们的 [Discord 社区](https://discord.gg/clawd)，一起构建更好的中文教程！\n\n---\n\n**Happy Coding!** 🚀🦐"},{"id":"welcome","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/welcome","editUrl":"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw-zh-docs/tree/main/blog/2021-08-26-welcome/index.md","source":"@site/blog/2021-08-26-welcome/index.md","title":"Welcome","description":"Docusaurus blogging features are powered by the blog plugin.","date":"2021-08-26T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":false,"label":"Facebook","permalink":"/blog/tags/facebook","description":"Facebook tag description"},{"inline":false,"label":"Hello","permalink":"/blog/tags/hello","description":"Hello tag description"},{"inline":false,"label":"Docusaurus","permalink":"/blog/tags/docusaurus","description":"Docusaurus tag description"}],"readingTime":0.56,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Sébastien Lorber","title":"Docusaurus maintainer","url":"https://sebastienlorber.com","page":{"permalink":"/blog/authors/all-sebastien-lorber-articles"},"socials":{"x":"https://x.com/sebastienlorber","linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/sebastienlorber/","github":"https://github.com/slorber","newsletter":"https://thisweekinreact.com"},"imageURL":"https://github.com/slorber.png","key":"slorber"},{"name":"Yangshun Tay","title":"Ex-Meta Staff Engineer, Co-founder GreatFrontEnd","url":"https://linkedin.com/in/yangshun","page":{"permalink":"/blog/authors/yangshun"},"socials":{"x":"https://x.com/yangshunz","linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/yangshun/","github":"https://github.com/yangshun","newsletter":"https://www.greatfrontend.com"},"imageURL":"https://github.com/yangshun.png","key":"yangshun"}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"welcome","title":"Welcome","authors":["slorber","yangshun"],"tags":["facebook","hello","docusaurus"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"欢迎来到 OpenClaw 中文教程","permalink":"/blog/welcome"},"nextItem":{"title":"MDX Blog Post","permalink":"/blog/mdx-blog-post"}},"content":"[Docusaurus blogging features](https://docusaurus.io/docs/blog) are powered by the [blog plugin](https://docusaurus.io/docs/api/plugins/@docusaurus/plugin-content-blog).\n\nHere are a few tips you might find useful.\n\n<!-- truncate -->\n\nSimply add Markdown files (or folders) to the `blog` directory.\n\nRegular blog authors can be added to `authors.yml`.\n\nThe blog post date can be extracted from filenames, such as:\n\n- `2019-05-30-welcome.md`\n- `2019-05-30-welcome/index.md`\n\nA blog post folder can be convenient to co-locate blog post images:\n\n![Docusaurus Plushie](./docusaurus-plushie-banner.jpeg)\n\nThe blog supports tags as well!\n\n**And if you don't want a blog**: just delete this directory, and use `blog: false` in your Docusaurus config."},{"id":"mdx-blog-post","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/mdx-blog-post","editUrl":"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw-zh-docs/tree/main/blog/2021-08-01-mdx-blog-post.mdx","source":"@site/blog/2021-08-01-mdx-blog-post.mdx","title":"MDX Blog Post","description":"Blog posts support Docusaurus Markdown features, such as MDX.","date":"2021-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":false,"label":"Docusaurus","permalink":"/blog/tags/docusaurus","description":"Docusaurus tag description"}],"readingTime":0.27,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Sébastien Lorber","title":"Docusaurus maintainer","url":"https://sebastienlorber.com","page":{"permalink":"/blog/authors/all-sebastien-lorber-articles"},"socials":{"x":"https://x.com/sebastienlorber","linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/sebastienlorber/","github":"https://github.com/slorber","newsletter":"https://thisweekinreact.com"},"imageURL":"https://github.com